      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And working together ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "with him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " we entreat also that ye receive not the grace of God in vain",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.6.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "(for he saith,At an acceptable time I hearkened unto thee,\nAnd in a day of salvation did I succor thee:behold, now is the acceptable time; behold, now is the day of salvation):",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.6.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "giving no occasion of stumbling in anything, that our ministration be not blamed;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.6.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "but in everything commending ourselves, as ministers of God, in much patience, in afflictions, in necessities, in distresses,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.6.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "in stripes, in imprisonments, in tumults, in labors, in watchings, in fastings;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.6.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "in pureness, in knowledge, in longsuffering, in kindness, in the Holy Spirit, in love unfeigned,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.6.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "in the word of truth, in the power of God; by the armor of righteousness on the right hand and on the left,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.6.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "by glory and dishonor, by evil report and good report; as deceivers, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "yet",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " true;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.6.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "as unknown, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "yet",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " well known; as dying, and behold, we live; as chastened, and not killed;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.6.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "as sorrowful, yet always rejoicing; as poor, yet making many rich; as having nothing, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "yet",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " possessing all things.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.6.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Our mouth is open unto you, O Corinthians, our heart is enlarged.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.6.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ye are not straitened in us, but ye are straitened in your own affections.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.6.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now for a recompense in like kind (I speak as unto ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "my",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " children), be ye also enlarged.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.6.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Be not unequally yoked with unbelievers: for what fellowship have righteousness and iniquity? or what communion hath light with darkness?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.6.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And what concord hath Christ with Belial? or what portion hath a believer with an unbeliever?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.6.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And what agreement hath a temple of God with idols? for we are a temple of the living God; even as God said, I will dwell in them, and walk in them; and I will be their God, and they shall be my people.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.6.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "WhereforeCome ye out from among them, and be ye separate,saith the Lord,\nAnd touch no unclean thing;\nAnd I will receive you,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.6.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.6.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And will be to you a Father,\nAnd ye shall be to me sons and daughters,saith the Lord Almighty.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ]
}
